arerumono, with everything from stages to items and so on themed around the franchise. In addition to playable characters from Utawarerumono, many characters will also appear in the adventure parts throughout the story. The game features a fully-voiced \u201cStory\u201d mode, the series\u2019 mainstay \u201cOffline Match\u201d mode, and\u2014for the first time in the Dokapon series\u2014an \u201cOnline Match\u201d mode allowing you to play against everyone from friends to strangers.", "themes": [{"id": 40, "name": "Party"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/dokapon-up-mugen-no-roulette", "videos": [{"id": 41086, "name": "Trailer", "video_id": "y4GrXsTbozE", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=y4GrXsTbozE", "title": "\u300c\u30c9\u30ab\u30dd\u30f3UP! \u5922\u5e7b\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30ec\u30c3\u30c8\u300d\u30d7\u30ed\u30e2\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/y4GrXsTbozE/maxresdefault.jpg"}, {"id": 170033, "name": "Game Intro", "video_id": "j_iGj9kRfd8", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=j_iGj9kRfd8", "title": "\u300c\u30c9\u30ab\u30dd\u30f3UP! \u5922\u5e7b\u306e\u30eb\u30fc\u30ec\u30c3\u30c8\u300d\u30aa\u30fc\u30d7\u30cb\u30f3\u30b0\u30e0\u30fc\u30d3\u30fc", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/j_iGj9kRfd8/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}